      "writtenOn": "2023-12-08T17:49:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One way would be to add support to Floss so that flags can be enabled there.\n\nAnother way is to add another macro here:\npackages/modules/Bluetooth/flags/exported_include/android_bluetooth_flags.h\n\nThe flag check would default to true when floss is defined.\n\nIS_FLAG_ENABLED_TRUE_ON_FLOSS(smp_tx_complete_callback) ?",
